      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms. For material changes, we will notify you before they take effect.
        If you do not agree, you can stop using the Service before then. Continuing to use the Service
        after that means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>App stores</h2>
      <p>
        If you download a Rakazo app from an app store, that store’s terms also apply to the app. For
        the iOS app, Apple’s Standard EULA applies. Apple is not a party to these terms and is not
        responsible for the Service or its support.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Delaware, without regard to its conflict
        of law rules. Disputes will be resolved in the state or federal courts located in Delaware,
        except where your local law gives you the right to bring a claim where you live. To the extent
        permitted by law, you and we each waive any right to a jury trial.
      </p>

      <h2>General</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are the entire agreement
        between you and us about the Service. If any part is unenforceable, the rest stays in effect.
        Not enforcing a term is not a waiver. You may not transfer these terms without our consent; we
        may transfer them in connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets. Neither of us is
        responsible for delays caused by events beyond reasonable control. We may send you notices by
        email or in the Service, and you can send notices to us at the address below.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Inbox Zero Inc.<br />
        131 Continental Dr, Suite 305<br />
        Newark, Delaware 19713, United States<br />
        <a href="mailto:hello@rakazo.com">hello@rakazo.com</a>
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
